msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Fine, then you don’t have to let me in.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But please at least hear me out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫알겠어. ⟪k:2⟫그럼 ⟪k:3⟫이대로여도 돼. ⟪k:4⟫내 말을 들어 줘."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0DCD6C30_1AA6_4355_A4E7_5D88B49F514A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 397c338dc27b900d0c69427dc12c4bfb7b4206e1825649ea6510a219d21adf57
