msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Do you remember the day, shortly after we first met, when we went on our honeymoon—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫if you can even call the little walk we took a “honeymoon”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫………예전 그 시간을 ⟪k:1⟫기억해? ⟪k:2⟫나와 네가 만나 ⟪k:3⟫무늬만 신혼여행이던 ⟪k:4⟫산책을 나간 "
"날 말이야."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EB8BE68_C493_4B2F_9754_C84D02B1D6D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e36aeec11dbb19d1e23767201788be3856d7e3be264a711cef516d57bc2b7093
