msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫However, at the photography shop, when you saw the phenakistoscope, you smiled for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그래도―― ⟪k:2⟫사진관에서 페나키스토스코프를 보여 줬을 때, ⟪k:3⟫너는 웃어 줬지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2464D230_600A_4746_8E3B_401DF78C5987
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f13ee01b8885dffcae845e8d1e4135bd5c0a008166f133f08ec762ce85d4a59a
