msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was... ⟪k:1⟫I was genuinely pleased in that moment."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는, ⟪k:1⟫사실…… ⟪k:2⟫그때 기뻤어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A10FC2F_5A65_43FC_B4D6_EA158DC04EBF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79580b937a8f3f6188cd03f8074fe37267b64d05ac93e2e35be35f58dc4c6627
