msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I very much doubt that was actually an appropriate present for a noblewoman like "
"yourself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫상식적으로 보면―― ⟪k:2⟫귀족 여자에게 줄 만한 게 아니었지?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AE64D2D4_72C3_4570_9C9B_CC092ECBF7B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2308488a42df02dbb4c1d79f1c1a62152501f10a7eade4f9d01fa1dbed54d6ec
#. default-sha256: 232119681c82709d3a44b97c3aa3ca7a10247616dc1e657bd0588aa46eb1773d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AE64D2D4_72C3_4570_9C9B_CC092ECBF7B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jewels or flowers or something like that—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫something beautiful—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫would "
"have certainly suited you better."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫보석이나, ⟪k:1⟫꽃다발――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그런 아름다운 것들이 더 좋았을 거야."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C29791DF_946F_4063_95CC_BFE677E70E4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea2f07381db919b2410b3112663a35c31ddb372ae5249f98a4b7d716cf1861df
