msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_25D7D30A_890E_450B_9D32_3D08EBA4B641"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You are, after all, a beautiful woman.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I did not want to have to compete on the "
"same field as those other men."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫너는 아름다운 여자니까 말이야.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……나는 ⟪k:3⟫다른 남자들과 똑같아 보이긴 싫었어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1A65C782_4D12_46A1_903B_44A8BBECBA68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98c3fa9ddf8a3cef4f13008528500af88b44cb11e0cef69ed5e696c8643575b4
#. default-sha256: b77c2da06d11dd7abf6d7166c012b5cf312296b810ec23d08779d2a19cc31e9e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1A65C782_4D12_46A1_903B_44A8BBECBA68"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted to be special—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No, I wanted to be ⟪k:4⟫unique⟪k:5⟫ to you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네 안에서 ⟪k:1⟫특별한―― 아니, ⟪k:2⟫특수한 상대이고 싶었지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_10147F57_FE9E_489C_864D_4AD1C79148B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f2393e3d389555c4a806990bf28248b984034f7e90593b8693f9b1be0f57317
#. default-sha256: f094e0f44e7b1428023785baef1a79b826a35a8f425535f560ac6f7d2f4d9d94
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_10147F57_FE9E_489C_864D_4AD1C79148B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No one had ever shown you anything of the sort before, had they?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……그런 걸 보여 주는 남자는 ⟪k:1⟫처음이었지?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_24CDFCC3_5F65_48B3_A6B8_FC96CA179226
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9df5e806924a53fa843763a86be4ef3a6c223c0acb73e6498cd207537ebcf6ff
#. default-sha256: 33f9c26206092b1db5494f9ad21221ea60789bd777dedc2ad135db8f35f2841d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_24CDFCC3_5F65_48B3_A6B8_FC96CA179226"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Frankly, I wasn’t sure if a woman of your status would take any interest in a "
"phenakistoscope at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫귀족인 네가 ⟪k:1⟫마음에 들어 할진…… 솔직히 ⟪k:2⟫불안했지만서도."

#: scenario3:scenario3_34376F6A_E076_4BBE_8B79_457847B89390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab8bd519b11466b5bfb5a5f1f47c4c49bff0f0ee919aacc18c5cfb258d9fc150
#. default-sha256: fc2bf794f00c4bb9381f5cfc7a73944c260833690b405785151eb629ceefdb16
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_34376F6A_E076_4BBE_8B79_457847B89390"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine you’ve thrown it out by now,⟪k:1⟫but I choose to believe you sincerely liked it on "
"that day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그건 이미 버렸겠지만――, 그래도 ⟪k:1⟫그때 기뻐해 준 건 ⟪k:2⟫진심일 거라 믿어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C51409A2_B8A6_403A_8B97_16CC37DF799A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20d7e84a0a8e77e7a66a7fc80876ea34a070c099550dfdf8d0411cd25de7d6ef
#. default-sha256: b4961d7e6c77c9b8f60c7306fdb9929dbeb6ff3dc70c8e8bb0a0ad80f2e8daf4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C51409A2_B8A6_403A_8B97_16CC37DF799A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That... ⟪k:2⟫if just for a moment... ⟪k:3⟫I caught your eye.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Even if you "
"started seeing other men afterwards,⟪k:6⟫that moment was real, wasn’t it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫비록 ⟪k:2⟫그 후에…… 네가 다른 남자와 관계를 가졌더라도.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그때는…… 나를 봐 준 거"
"잖아. ⟪k:5⟫맞지?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F6BB0F89_5D8D_4091_8F2A_70C4461515A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c35a2466dac6ed7d1d6c06c547902240eeaed3cac9a45eb0eb0f19e0296dde73
#. default-sha256: 9f9fa6277c17b8bf6e49c2d4de60a5a116b7e0ffedb90958b87d230548b4aaaf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F6BB0F89_5D8D_4091_8F2A_70C4461515A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our marriage was, at its core, nothing but an arrangement between our parents—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫an "
"exchange of money and influence. ⟪k:3⟫That was how it began, but..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……나와 너는, ⟪k:1⟫결국 부모들끼리 정한 혼인 관계라―― 돈과 권력 교환에 불과했어. ⟪k:2⟫처음엔 "
"그랬지. ⟪k:3⟫하지만……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79E95E01_65C2_40A3_8F1C_E519BC58414A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ddef9a6e79dd501760070537a436b35dc42ab873055eb9da9f586e2d5733e84
#. default-sha256: 521df420a0db7d9a49772d8757c3779c0765c22dd41e0e150bedce465cfcc84f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79E95E01_65C2_40A3_8F1C_E519BC58414A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but that day, I..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도…… ⟪k:1⟫나는, ⟪k:2⟫그 날…… 네게……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_21396CFF_A67C_4F00_B612_493E9FA0823C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 296ad6fed47e748a80282cbf1ebd3db5ffe0fd06f68de6a2bf790a3a56d48955
#. default-sha256: 7248f4f6f454f852d099d67cc564d7e48c2ebd8247ced6ef3748ae1c0046fda8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_21396CFF_A67C_4F00_B612_493E9FA0823C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I loved you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫네게 사랑에 빠졌어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_21396CFF_A67C_4F00_B612_494E9FA0823C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9dadfca9692025b78fb641d6d8b78a490eccd4e63a1b9b9b0a39c567d660db7
#. default-sha256: b323f68b81895d35804a09df6fe4048e1752641e8d78667b8c43e72623a7ef1d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_21396CFF_A67C_4F00_B612_494E9FA0823C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I yearned to see you smile, as if I had loved you my entire life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫먼 옛날부터 그러던 것처럼…… ⟪k:1⟫네 미소를 바랐어……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0352CFC8_82ED_4BF8_98D4_B58939A8BB5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 403a515c99482d1c22f19e581672f82cd221d55f55ba28f2e0b8b02a304339c4
#. default-sha256: 5761beabc7faa87e26966666c2189054245830ab677f6cca8d414d7dfe9a2b3f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0352CFC8_82ED_4BF8_98D4_B58939A8BB5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫.................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A70A1A3B_E63C_4A6F_BCA7_766FC1F66E56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c06ad5158a290ae092522aa25759d2b7f80b47ba1b54c89816c863a9da965e32
#. default-sha256: 3d42598e57bda5a63fff7d6536dfa1bfc57cf57bb3dab1cc4a3452b678b7bc87
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A70A1A3B_E63C_4A6F_BCA7_766FC1F66E56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The Pacific Railroad has finally been completed.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That’s the project I’ve been "
"funding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……대륙횡단철도가, ⟪k:2⟫마침내 완성됐어.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫내가 꾸준히 투자한 ⟪k:5⟫그 사업이……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F57CD18F_9014_4188_99D5_85964CB6D019
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5ba462e1b87f1143ae667667edb4b6a394d6d28b1876562fe3c51fde61a537b
#. default-sha256: 26adf686bd8f828c4e2a5aa1e0b72483839950033c0204ede2379a2017ab41e0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F57CD18F_9014_4188_99D5_85964CB6D019"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Everyone thought it was crazy, but a railroad now stretches across the breadth of this "
"country."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫누구나 무모하다 한 ⟪k:2⟫신대륙 횡단이―― 이루어졌어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_14316D0F_1011_4836_9061_83FE1482E76E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e5c3e1dca99761feff0d38e10ab6cef7368ba23ff89636b3fc7f7c1ec00cf91
#. default-sha256: dc77f1e9f0b44dc550da29ee3018d035a15dc8344e75cb155195c5b0549d0bfc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14316D0F_1011_4836_9061_83FE1482E76E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A joining ceremony will be held tomorrow.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s going to be a grand event.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Locally, they’re planning on doing a gun salute."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내일, ⟪k:1⟫개통식을 해. ⟪k:2⟫아주 성대할 거야.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫이 지역에선 축포가 준비되었고――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_739CCDA0_9720_49BA_B979_1BFE5CB73329
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99695c7cac895fb28371c163ce85b10118d04e292567bc00d0d131b25ef91d55
#. default-sha256: f5f4ae152e33862b14f0291114fbd4e5e2ad922a102c7a2178b60da4578294bc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_739CCDA0_9720_49BA_B979_1BFE5CB73329"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the sound of the last spike being driven into the ground will be transmitted across the "
"country via telegraph."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫개통 순간에는, ⟪k:1⟫마지막 대못을 박는 소리가 ⟪k:2⟫전신을 통해 각지에 전해질 거야."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F5EA36F4_C623_4342_9A43_D8DCE50A32F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e40bbce9ad8ec2f6c7ac1a00b1813a408e786c37a67904547b064c2caabec366
#. default-sha256: 52967f0a1be8b24967020f9e7ae4eb6232b87a4f11bb105267a45f90572e1d91
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F5EA36F4_C623_4342_9A43_D8DCE50A32F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have procured a telegraph,⟪k:1⟫so we can listen to it here in the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫전신기를 준비해 놨으니―― 이 저택에도 전해져."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B281F736_33E9_4FF7_BCD4_BA52B27BAB95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b134af19429b805902d414ec7a189ccbfb27130893af8b3f1a74c2a6e2b5f118
#. default-sha256: 50ca0980cb1e5cced0c35ee3f555a2efe3540da355add60d222cacf2a6921214
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B281F736_33E9_4FF7_BCD4_BA52B27BAB95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In your condition, you would probably have trouble handling the crowds at the telegraph "
"station."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫너는 몸이 약하지?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫전신국은 사람들로 붐빌 거 아니야."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A0A43771_71E3_44BC_9BBF_D8A60F358F86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 192b268529856e6dcb9f53c831af159ccb7d83b4b853e8bd4ba4e88fe957faff
#. default-sha256: 21e18ab1f122bda2e1797a7d1bad4b526941fe799af45a15c1fe49564bc7768d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A0A43771_71E3_44BC_9BBF_D8A60F358F86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But here, you could celebrate in the comfort of your own home.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I suppose what I’m "
"saying is..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫집 안에서라면 ⟪k:1⟫마음 편히 개통을 반길 수 있어. ⟪k:2⟫그게――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_81E42522_0BDE_43FF_9859_5EF4E884625F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccdc3e2c31efc59ed6c442616f5b57a3fe58f5a655e924c1049cf36d3553a924
#. default-sha256: 81cc68dec9a9dcd71f4e7298489ce66b88327465e7d48eec22d8e60ef6354193
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81E42522_0BDE_43FF_9859_5EF4E884625F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I want to celebrate this with you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나와 네가, ⟪k:1⟫함께."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D2B4FC5_0C3A_4CDF_A318_F967DF99A2B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcccf3ce5a7a0538dcf1022b4e6d99bf17aae75a02c956e3da3f4f245a9b140d
#. default-sha256: 760dcb48428af5d0f855ca1cc73643c333f3494fddc93887076722210decbbf4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9D2B4FC5_0C3A_4CDF_A318_F967DF99A2B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I have made arrangements to make that possible for you,⟪k:1⟫because I wish to have you "
"there, with me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫너도 같이 들을 수 있게……, ⟪k:1⟫준비해 놨어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나는, ⟪k:4⟫너와 함께―― 반기고 싶어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A404614C_3052_454E_838A_4A79BC813CB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1b91d75875e92e2cfd5fc52be4d14085f0bc5eb2d3a52760f2f1f1d3300c5c5
#. default-sha256: 7781d1171fc65733a891f44a993419e0324c194b62fab9a0d6e293cbd2522d2d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A404614C_3052_454E_838A_4A79BC813CB2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Would you be willing... ⟪k:2⟫tomorrow...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫to celebrate the completion of the "
"Pacific Railroad with me?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……내일……, ⟪k:2⟫함께……, ⟪k:3⟫대륙횡단철도의 완성을…….⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫반겨 주지 ⟪k:6⟫않을래."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8AE9C091_7F56_44F1_B323_35C5598735FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9ec310593f70dbf40e6a31bcf5a907ca96e0fac10e6bd3631c1c020dd11c6de
#. default-sha256: dc113dac666a0659c038c0160ad8ba069c8f32ce5b0094b3b515ed2383da65b4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8AE9C091_7F56_44F1_B323_35C5598735FB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Would you be there at my side?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫곁에 있어 주지 않을래……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B8F4C74F_1C25_44FA_B6A4_ECF6B8AD8BBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 806630c315f36cb44747ecc65177f23f016976fd263f4532b88e1555a23b592d
