msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Please... ⟪k:4⟫say something!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫―――큭, ⟪k:2⟫제발……, ⟪k:3⟫대답해 줘!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_08928E0F_C453_4BB9_9477_988B12B54453
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d815265a6b1dead02fba73f2e3450875beabacdca404c7e11dbefe84bf2313d
#. default-sha256: e4e77fe30cc9d28ce63ab06f138c4d34cdde05ebb8ce2a56120cc6bc65aaf5d2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_08928E0F_C453_4BB9_9477_988B12B54453"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I want to start over!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know very well what I’ve done to you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는―― ⟪k:1⟫너와, ⟪k:2⟫화해하고 싶단 말이야!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫내가 무슨 짓을 저질렀는진 알아!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D8ED12F2_6C63_43DC_A572_2BD0A24FE166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e790bdb0d0f7c2891b702bca0e12225e03da83e0c6d54e9f375e0c9084828033
#. default-sha256: 8cfd5d68497e7c52d2e42a57325ba767978ead3afa9eb78cb8cd15b1207077ae
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D8ED12F2_6C63_43DC_A572_2BD0A24FE166"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You may be at fault yourself, but what I did is unacceptable!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫비록 네게 잘못한 점이 있긴 해도―― ⟪k:2⟫내 행동은 도가 지나쳤어!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그래도――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_093F3019_CF2B_4CDE_809E_23DB757E2F15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35023b176e98efb0e6c1c37593fef72cfe06334cfeacb23459ca891141ddc1a3
#. default-sha256: 272a88280acce44027aaf003e0757233c06c1c83646ca934b9f66aa1a15f2a1d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_093F3019_CF2B_4CDE_809E_23DB757E2F15"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But what I did... ⟪k:1⟫was a consequence of my overpowering love for you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I swear "
"it!"
